{"ref":"BDB, אוּרִיָּה","hw":"אוּרִיָּה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּרִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>flame of Yah</em> or <em>my light is Yah</em> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָהּ\" href=\"/BDB,_יָהּ\", dir=\"rtl\">יָהּ</a><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  Hittite husband of Bathsheba <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.3\">2 S 11:3f</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:39\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.39\">23:39</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  priest in reign of Ahaz <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.2\">Is 8:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.10\">2 K 16:10f.</a><br><strong>3.</strong>  priest in time of Nehemiah <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.4\">Ne 3:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">8:4</a>.","next":"BDB, אוּרִיָּ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, אוּרִיאֵל"}